            "notes": "With the changes to  [Superconductor](item_6781242d-405f-44f8-ab3f-4a590551f531) and  [Lynx\u2019s Datadrive](item_b1a53f99-b92f-42b7-8791-2be505f81186) they are no longer considered as optimal choices with the exception of  [Superconductor](item_6781242d-405f-44f8-ab3f-4a590551f531) for later rounds \n\nThe main item you would want to purchase now is  [Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643). This item gives you overhealth when you are poking with  [Volskaya Vortex](item_4a24240a-a0b1-4a0e-83d1-acf8c5647b5b) and it helps with your sustain.\n\nAlternatively you can purchase any of the blue items if you are struggling with cash.\n\n [Blastproof Boots](item_530190fc-db36-481e-9bd7-4a0a05c5e53d)  and  [Protein Shake](item_3766d87a-71b4-4752-91e4-ac054cb0ea49) are great vs super aggro comps that are on you constantly. (Blastproof boots is now a great item to have always and i incorporate it a lot into my builds now)",
