            "notes": "[Containment Shield](item_0406217c-a6af-4a19-8c7d-052c4d402848) is now the better round 3 buy over  [Major Flex](item_f54587d0-45d9-4cf8-993f-49819767f924) as it helps you kite a lot and it does a flat 5% of you max hp per sec  in healing so it's really good for self sustain.\n\nDepending on your cash you can shift your items around to either have more CDR or have more mobility with  [Blastproof Boots](item_530190fc-db36-481e-9bd7-4a0a05c5e53d) or you can sell all of your items besides  [Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643) and get  [Cybervenom](item_210a8582-91ec-4cf3-968a-a443f3a0c505) as your 2nd item for some heal reduction",
