            "created_at": "2025-07-16T17:38:10.324627+00:00",
            "notes": "[Major Flex](item_f54587d0-45d9-4cf8-993f-49819767f924) is now our round 5 power that we take helps you have high damage and helps you build grav fast. Works great when you have someone like  [Reaper](hero_0449752f-1c58-487b-b9a0-ca727d784457) ,  [Genji](hero_31fd201d-2f46-41e4-b125-9fa9e55fed46) or,  [Mei](hero_36fd67f0-19df-4c50-add9-709cfb147cb0) .\n\nThe core items you should have will be  [Hardlight Accelerator](item_0390c8af-2a68-4da2-b876-93da32c3f448)  [Cybervenom](item_210a8582-91ec-4cf3-968a-a443f3a0c505) and  [Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643). After that you can choose any of the optional items listed below\n\n [Blastproof Boots](item_530190fc-db36-481e-9bd7-4a0a05c5e53d) highly recommend taking this item if you want more mobility, other than that take items that will give you more CDR or more damage you don't really need anything past 20% AP IMO\n\n [Superconductor](item_6781242d-405f-44f8-ab3f-4a590551f531) is not a bad item still it'll make you a bit more tanky if you really need it",
